WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Opening montage of inclusive sporting events across India.]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Narrator: For ten years, Adventures Beyond Barriers Foundation has brought people together through sport.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Breaking stereotypes and building a community where no one is left behind.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
From city runs to snow-covered trails, every experience is a step toward inclusion.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Participants and allies share moments of joy, challenge, and partnership.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Volunteers and corporate partners describe how inclusive adventures changed their perspective.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Narrator: The journey continues — with you.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Whether you participate, volunteer, ally, or donate, you help rewrite the story of disability inclusion.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:25.000
[Closing title: Adventures Beyond Barriers Foundation — Strength Lies in Community.]
